T* (␀m␀a␀n␀a␀g␀e␀m␀e␀n␀t␀ ␀\(␀A␀U␀M␀\)␀ ␀a␀c␀r␀o␀s␀s␀ ␀t␀h␀e␀ ␀I␀n␀d␀i␀a␀n␀ ␀m␀u␀t␀u␀a␀l␀ ␀f␀u␀n␀d␀ ␀i␀n␀d␀u␀s␀t␀r␀y␀ ␀h␀a␀v␀e␀ ␀c␀r␀o␀s␀s␀e␀d␀  ¹␀5␀0␀ ␀l␀a␀k␀h␀ ␀c␀r␀o␀r␀e␀ ␀\(␀o␀v␀e␀r␀ ␀$␀6␀0␀0␀ ␀b␀i␀l␀l␀i␀o␀n␀ ␀U␀S␀D␀\)␀,␀ ␀d␀r␀i␀v␀e␀n) Tj
T* (primarily by millions of salaried households participating through monthly Systematic Investment Plans \(SIPs\).) Tj
ET
