/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
70.8661417322834666 637.5120472440944468 Td
(Traditionally, retail investors bought mutual funds through local distributors or commercial bank branches. These legacy) Tj
T* (routes sold 'Regular' plans carrying embedded distributor commissions between 1.0% and 2.25% annually. Over a) Tj
T* (20-year horizon, these ongoing fees can erode an investor's terminal wealth by up to 30%. While SEBI mandated) Tj
T* (zero-commission 'Direct' plans in 2013, self-directed investors soon encountered friction: keeping track of different folios) Tj
T* (across more than 40 Asset Management Companies \(AMCs\) meant managing dozens of separate portal logins, PINs,) Tj
T* (and statement formats.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
70.8661417322834666 552.7561417322833677 Td
(Modern consumer investment apps like Zerodha Coin and Groww helped make mutual fund purchases accessible from a) Tj
T* (smartphone. However, as investors accumulate schemes across equity, debt, and hybrid categories, new operational) Tj
T* (gaps become apparent: fragmented portfolio visibility, inaccurate return metrics, and a total lack of tools for independent) Tj
T* (financial advisors who help families manage long-term goals.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.118 0.161 0.231 rg
70.8661417322834666 492.9451181102361943 Td
(FinTrackPro was developed to bridge this gap. Engineered as a full-stack, cloud-native wealth management platform, it) Tj
T* (combines real-time AMFI NAV tracking, mathematical XIRR calculation using the Newton-Raphson method, bank-grade) Tj
T* (multi-factor authentication, and a dedicated partner portal for AMFI-registered mutual fund distributors \(like Velocity) Tj
T* (Wealth, ARN 348996\) to manage client onboarding, KYC, and portfolio reviews in one place.) Tj
ET
