(Most retail portals calculate returns using simple absolute) Tj
T* (percentage or point-to-point Compound Annual Growth Rate) Tj
T* (\(CAGR\). However, mutual fund SIPs consist of staggered cash) Tj
T* (flows deposited on different dates. Applying CAGR to recurring) Tj
T* (SIP installments is mathematically invalid. Computing the exact) Tj
T* (Extended Internal Rate of Return \(XIRR\) requires finding the root) Tj
T* (of a non-linear polynomial equation, which many lightweight web) Tj
T* (apps skip due to algorithm complexity.) Tj
