(This dissertation is organized into nine sequential chapters: Chapter 1 outlines the introductory context; Chapter 2) Tj
T* (reviews literature and comparative systems; Chapter 3 conducts system analysis and feasibility studies; Chapter 4) Tj
T* (presents system design and 14 UML models; Chapter 5 details implementation, algorithms, and UI walkthroughs;) Tj
T* (Chapter 6 reports empirical results and benchmark graphs; Chapter 7 concludes the study; Chapter 8 provides IEEE) Tj
T* (references; and Chapter 9 contains technical appendices.) Tj
